<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\たたら場.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\奈落1.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Where... is this...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was strangely warm.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I should have been on a mountain path in Arata until just now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So it had been an April night, with a slightly chilly wind blowing.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But what about here? It was very warm, and there was no wind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And yet the air felt damp somehow.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n7000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "7000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\奈落2.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The moon that had been shining until a moment ago was gone too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because there was a ceiling above me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I couldn't really tell if it was rock or wood, but something on the ceiling was writhing, as if it were pulsing.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, not just the ceiling.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The walls and the floor were covered too, with long, thin things like tree roots running everywhere, and they were squirming like worms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I slowly stood up.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">That's weird.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'd been running all over the mountain until a moment ago, but I was hardly tired at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And my head felt clear, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The more I breathed, the fresher I felt, and the tiredness in my body faded even more.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Huh? Where is everyone?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In this space, about the size of a school classroom, there was no one but me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Wait, did I die?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Is this that afterlife thing?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Is that why my whole body feels so clear?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I put a hand on my chest.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My heart seemed to be pumping blood through my body the same as always.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I tried holding my breath.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then I started to feel short of breath, and my lungs moved right away, wanting fresh air.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Looks like I'm still alive.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, so you're awake."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Is that </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> calls me Haruka-'chan'.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So this is... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, then.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE>, where is this?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Looking around above me, I called out to no one in particular.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's no use. Look around all you want, there's no one there. You can only hear my voice."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm asking you where this is!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ha ha, that's an awful way to talk to your father. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―what kind of upbringing was she giving you?"</STYLE><PG>
"Father? Yeah, right! My <STYLE ID="5">real dad</STYLE> would never do something like this!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, it's true my mind isn't the same as it was when I was alive. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Oh, right, right, you asked where this is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">This is underground, beneath the summit of Mount Itohime."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The summit of Mount Itohime...?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">The Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is taking her rest at the moment. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The residents suddenly went on a rampage, so she had to put us to work in a hurry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">On top of that, she treated </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> so she wouldn't die, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is very tired indeed."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"With all that going on, we let our guard down in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and she got away, but, well, it's no big problem. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So rather than summoning </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I thought it would be better to bring </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> all here, that's all."</STYLE><PG>
"'You all'... So the others are here too?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Of course. We're keeping the others over here with us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Oh, they're safe, so you don't need to worry."</STYLE><PG>
"Why's it just me... Why am I the only one here all alone?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">The Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> surely wishes to talk with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, just the two of them, you see."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So where is she, this <STYLE ID="10">Goddess</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Look, take a good look. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She's been right in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> this whole time, hasn't she?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-1385\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-1385\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "SE\surprising_shock1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I brought my eyes, which had stayed fixed upward, back down level and looked around.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And there, over in the corner, was a black mass.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That was clearly different from the tree roots.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Like a clump of hair, long fibers, black and thin, were wound around something about an armful in size.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No way. Is that </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―the thing they call the core, or Abaddon?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Is it safe to go near it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It won't grab me and eat me, will it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Is that thing even alive in the first place?</STYLE><PG>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I walked toward the black mass.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had said it―she wanted to talk with me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So she probably wouldn't turn to violence all of a sudden.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\裏\あやか1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\奈落3.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ugh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A low scream slipped out of me before I could stop it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What I'd taken for a black, hairlike mass was, without a doubt, hair.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How many years would hair have to be left alone to get this long?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The hair covered something, and it spread out all around it, too.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="10">You</STYLE>'re... 
{PAUSE ""}
the core...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"　　　　　　　　"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="10">You</STYLE>'re a person, right...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"　　　　　　　　"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="10">You</STYLE>... who are you...?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">When I'd said that much, the mass moved faintly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As if in answer, my feet took a step back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then some of the hair that had covered the mass slipped down and fell away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\死月編\裏\あやか2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Something white peeked out through the gap.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It took me three blinks to realize it was skin.</STYLE><PG>
"So it is <STYLE ID="10">you</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"　　　　　　　　"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I don't know if you can understand me, but hear me out. 
{PAUSE ""}
I want you to turn <STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE> back to normal."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"　　　　　　　　"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I want you to make <STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE> the human she was before."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"　　　　　　　　"</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"　　　　　　　　"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"　　　　　　　　"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The mass kept up its sullen silence, same as before.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Either it didn't understand words, or it was speaking too quietly for me to hear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Either way, it looked like talking with me was impossible for it.</STYLE><PG>
"Sorry, looks like I had the wrong person."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"―placement"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I thought I'd heard a voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Faintly, from the black mass, a voice...</STYLE><PG>
"Did you... say something...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I tried to make my voice as gentle as I could, like I was talking to a little kid.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Can you say that one more time?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Replacement... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">want..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Replacement...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"That girl's... replacement..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">When it said that girl, did it mean </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From the sound of it, it meant that in exchange for freeing </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, someone else should become a divine messenger.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But of course, there was no way I could do that.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It had only been a little conversation, but whoever was inside this mass seemed like a young child.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12" RUBY="こわいろ">Not the voice</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> or anything. It was the stiffness in the way it talked that seemed weirdly childish.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If this was a child who died 20 years ago, showing up like this just as it was, should I appeal to its feelings instead of to reason?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I crouched down in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">the kid</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just as I thought, it didn't seem like it was going to jump at me out of nowhere.</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE>'s someone really important to us."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So, I want you to give her back. 
{PAUSE ""}
Didn't your mom or dad ever tell you it's wrong to take other people's things?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mom...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah."<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mommy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"I want to see Mommy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Your mommy, huh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"I want to see Mommyyy..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">This kid</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seemed even younger than I'd thought.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't hate kids, but I had no idea how to talk to someone that logic just didn't work on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Years and years ago, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> used to say it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Why is there no </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> at our house, she'd ask.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Back when she was only four or five, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seemed to ask that question of everyone she met.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One person said―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">she's watching over you from up in the sky.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Another person said―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">she's always there in </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s heart.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I said―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it's because she died.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Back then, I couldn't give an answer as thoughtful as the grown-ups'.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Looking back now, I think it was a really cold answer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"I saw it in a picture book. All living things die. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">But 'cause they die, their souls get born again and turn into new lives,"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> she said.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was way too young for an idea that hard.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> knew.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The people of Arata hunt the animals of the mountain, kill them, and eat them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The bones of the animals they eat are buried in graves.</STYLE>
