{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> must be happy somewhere else now, right?"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> she said.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Her view of life and death was so far from mine that I couldn't answer her at all.</STYLE>
