{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I never told anyone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because that was what I'd promised.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ホラー.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">But because of that, nearly 200,000 people died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I'd made it public, maybe it never would have gotten this horrible.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This past week, I've been crushed by that guilt.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It's been 15 years since then, and I've finally understood what they meant.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What that </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> thing was after―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it was to make me suffer like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To live as long as I can, and keep tasting that suffering the whole time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll probably go on living crushed by this guilt until the day I die.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Back then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">"It's a complete win for </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="5">,"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> or something like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No. It was a complete loss for me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s rescue, sure, is something nothing could ever replace.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But to them, it doesn't matter whether the one who becomes a divine messenger is </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> or anyone else.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Anyone infected with that drug will do.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">And above all, the reason I thought it was a complete loss for me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ever since then, that person has never been found.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------